2. Demands that Hamas and all other parties immediately and unconditionally release all hostages, including women, children, the elderly and the wounded, and calls for the dignified return of the remains of deceased hostages to their families, in accordance with international humanitarian law;
3. Condemns in the strongest terms the terrorist attacks by Hamas and other armed groups on 7 October 2023, the continued holding of hostages, and all attacks against civilians, including by Israeli forces, and calls upon all parties to refrain from using civilian infrastructure for military purposes; demands that Hamas cease all attacks against Israel and release all hostages immediately;
